<h1 class="pt-5 font-display text-3xl font-semibold">Abzeichen</h1><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">9 von 33 Stufen</p><section class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-around rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-violet-600 p-3 text-white">
